    // --- Illusion (shared-illusion phantasm spells). Wizard -> Mage per the
    // standard class-name mapping every other entry in this file already
    // uses. minor_illusion has two authored ability RONs (image + sound) but
    // only one compendium entry -- see
    // abilities/spells/illusion/minor_illusion_image.ron's own comment for
    // why the `ability` field below points only at the image mode.
    // project_image is COPY-ONLY: a stationary illusory double, not the
    // remote-viewpoint half of the source spell -- see
    // abilities/spells/illusion/project_image.ron's comment.
    //
    // `BasicSummon`'s `summon_distance` is a caster-relative placement fan,
    // not an aimed/targeted point the way e.g. clairvoyance's
    // server-validated `select_pos` is -- there is no range/LOS-checked
    // "cast at a distant point" path for this ability type today. The
    // three phantasm RONs below all use a tight `summon_distance: (1.0,
    // 2.0)`, so `range` here is set to match what the ability actually
    // does (Meters(2.0)) rather than a level-scaled distance that would
    // only be honest if a validated aimed-placement mechanism existed for
    // BasicSummon. A future addition of one (mirroring clairvoyance's
    // `select_pos` validation) could restore level-scaled range.
    (
        id: "spells.illusion.minor_illusion",
        name_i18n: "spell-minor_illusion",
        level: 0,
        school: Some(Illusion),
        source: Arcane,
        classes: [Bard, Sorcerer, Warlock, Mage],
        cast_time: Action,
        // Persists 180s (see minor_illusion_image.ron) -- not a one-shot
        // effect.
        duration: Secs(180.0),
        range: Meters(2.0),
        aoe: None,
        description_i18n: "spell-minor_illusion-desc",
        ability: "common.abilities.spells.illusion.minor_illusion_image",
    ),
    (
        id: "spells.illusion.silent_image",
